{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A class which wraps all "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"color semantic tokens"}]},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"multiple"}]},{"type":"text","text":" or not, and expose them."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllColorSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"text":" implementation to use.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange"]]},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeColorSemanticTokensProvider"}],"externalID":"s:16OUDSThemesOrange0B32ThemeColorSemanticTokensProviderC","roleHeading":"Class","title":"OrangeThemeColorSemanticTokensProvider","symbolKind":"class","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Theme Orange"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeColorSemanticTokensProvider"}]},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeColorSemanticTokensProvider\/init()"],"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeColorSemanticTokensProvider\/ColorMultipleSemanticTokens-Implementations","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeColorSemanticTokensProvider\/ColorSemanticTokens-Implementation